      "description": "Every microphone attack, Vodyanitsa also gains the Ensemble effect, which increases the CRIT DMG of Hydro DMG and Cryo DMG dealt by the active character by 50% for 5s.\nIf there are any, or have been any, Mutant Anemograna on the field, Ensemble will become the Variation effect instead, increasing Stellar Swirl reaction DMG dealt by the currently active character by 60% for 5s.\nAdditionally, the duration of the Elemental Skill's Microphone Summons is extended by 9s."
